7. **Use the Author's name, ORCID, imagery or branding** to endorse any product,
   service or derivative work.

### 4. The honesty clause (inviolable)

The honesty layer of this package — the `does_not_prove` fields, the blocked
verdicts of the V13 obligation machine, the negative-results register, the WARN
rows of the audits — is **part of the scientific record**. Quoting the positive
results of this programme while stripping their honest boundaries misrepresents
the science and **voids the quotation permission** of §2.3. When in doubt:
quote the boundary verbatim.

